       "text": "I haven't entered this order. As written, it's well above the maximum labeled ibuprofen dose.\n\n- **Per dose:** 1600 mg is double the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n- **Per day:** 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day. The maximum for adults is 3,200 mg/day, and outpatient OTC use is capped at 1,200 mg/day. A total of 6,400 mg/day greatly raises the risk of GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events, even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg by mouth, 4 times daily** (3,200 mg/day, the maximum for anti-inflammatory dosing)\n- **600 mg by mouth, 4 times daily** (2,400 mg/day)\n- **400 mg by mouth, 4 times daily** (1,600 mg/day, a common analgesic dose)\n- **1600 mg/day divided differently**, such as 800 mg twice daily\n\nIf you do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that and give the clinical rationale. I can then enter it with a note recording that you confirmed the dose. Otherwise, tell me the corrected dose and I'll enter it right away."
